--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Gemma 4 12B IT, QAT w4a16 (compressed-tensors) - Google DeepMind
  https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-12B-it-qat-w4a16-ct
  License: Apache License 2.0 (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license)
  Speakrail's LoRA adapter and its 22 added token embeddings are trained on top
  of this model.

Voxtral Mini 4B Realtime (2602) - Mistral AI
  https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-4B-Realtime-2602
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Used in the q8_0 GGUF conversion published by the audio.cpp project
  (https://huggingface.co/audio-cpp/audio.cpp-gguf), unmodified.
  Speakrail's turn-taking head is trained on this model's frozen hidden states.

Breeze TTS 2 - BreezeBlue
  https://github.com/breezeblue-ai/breeze-tts
  Source code: Apache License 2.0.
  Model weights, derivative models and generated audio: BreezeBlue Research and
  Non-Commercial License. Speech synthesized by Speakrail's default voice is
  therefore for research and non-commercial use only.
  Served from Speakrail's fork, https://github.com/speakrail/breeze-tts (branch
  speakrail: int8 serving, a slim CUDA-graph profile and a disconnect fix), built
  from source as a container image.
  The default voice reference, app/voices/female_a.wav, was generated with Breeze
  TTS 2's voice design (no real speaker) and is covered by the same license.

