Software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

audio.cpp (speech recognition server) - Speakrail fork
  https://github.com/speakrail/audio.cpp
  Forked from audio.cpp by ShugoAI LLC: https://github.com/0xShug0/audio.cpp
  Copyright 2026 ShugoAI LLC. License: Apache License 2.0.
  The fork (branch turn-head) adds the turn-taking head and peek decoding.
  Built from source as a container image; no audio.cpp code is included in
  this repository. It bundles ggml (MIT), SentencePiece (Apache License 2.0),
  cJSON (MIT) and other libraries under their own licenses; see the fork.

vLLM - https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
  License: Apache License 2.0. Used unmodified as a container image.

Onest (font of the web UI) - https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Onest
